  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">WB Financial Sector Recovery and Resilience 2017-2025 - Financial Sector Recovery and Resilience Ukraine</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">WB Financial Sector Recovery and Resilience 2017-2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">M&#xe5;let med f&#xf6;rslagna insatsen &#xe4;r att st&#xf6;dja reformer inom finansiella sektorn f&#xf6;r att skapa b&#xe4;ttre f&#xf6;ruts&#xe4;ttningar f&#xf6;r h&#xe5;llbar ekonomisk tillv&#xe4;xt. Insatsen kommer bidra till f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra finansiell stabilitet, st&#xf6;dja  utvecklingen av en mera h&#xe5;llbar och stabil banksektor och fr&#xe4;mja diversifiering inom finansiella sektorn i linje med europeiska standards. Detta kommer leda till en mera inkluderande finansiell sektor som gynnar b&#xe5;de individer och sm&#xe5; och mellanstora f&#xf6;retag.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The goal of the contribution is to strengthen the financial sector so that it can function as a driver of economic growth. This will be achieved through implementing reforms aimed at enhancing financial stability, facilitating sustainable development of the banking sector, and promoting financial system diversification.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of this technical assistance project is to strengthen the financial sector in Ukraine as a driver of sustainable and inclusive economic growth by implementing reforms aimed at enhancing financial stability and resilience, facilitate sustainable banking sector development and efficiency, and promote sustainable financial system diversification and inclusion. 
Ukrainian citizens and private enterprises are the ultimate beneficiaries of a more diversified and efficient financial sector, benefiting from more diverse and competitive financial services, ultimately leading to job creation and sustainable growth.</narrative>
  </description>
